; abnf stdio.tiff diff (binary) — protocol::OpBinary: raw UTF-8 JSON bytes of TiffDiff,
; NOT wrapped in the shared `.semio` envelope (contrast with ../../📸️snapshot/💾️binary/).
; No length prefix: the entire op body IS the JSON document.
document  = json-object
json-object = *OCTET   ; UTF-8 JSON object per sibling ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio
